  {
    "id": "golden-son",
    "type": "book",
    "title": "Golden Son",
    "creator": "Pierce Brown",
    "series": "Red Rising Saga",
    "seriesNumber": 2,
    "status": "finished",
    "rating": 5,
    "finished": "2026-09-19",
    "dateApprox": true,
    "added": "2026-02-10",
    "year": 2015,
    "pages": 466,
    "cover": "/shelf/golden-son.jpg",
    "color": "#986c17",
    "review": "If I could give this a 4.5, I would\n\nGreat book, the twists were amazing. I thought the duel with Cassius would be my favourite scene, but then there was the meeting with the Sovereign.. and then there was the ares reveal.. the red reveal.. and of course the finale.\n\nSo many good scenes. I’m not a fan of the space battles, and the war lost me until the invasion portion. But the political warfare? The twists? Amazing.\n\nI do however think the character work, needs some work. Cassius was one of the most built on characters, and it felt like he said nothing this book. He had memorable scenes, but where’s the dialogue!? \n\nLorne was my favourite, great character.",
    "link": "https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/18966819"
  },
  {
    "id": "light-bringer",
    "type": "book",
